        "app_name": "RC Pilot Trainer",
        "release_date": "1980-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
        "description": "Experience the thrill of R/C airplane flying! \nThis simulator puts you in control of a highly realistic airplane in a beautifully rendered environment, recreating the precision and excitement of line-of-sight flying. Perfect for beginners and seasoned pilots alike, this VR experience offers a unique way to enjoy R/C flight—rain or shine.\n\nSeasoned pilots can use it to keep their skills sharp when the weather isn’t ideal, while newcomers will find it an accessible way to practice fundamental maneuvers. With its true-to-life controls and immersive visuals, this app lets you soar as if you were really at the field, guiding your plane through the sky with skill and precision.\n\nOptionally use a gamepad or connect your actual R/C transmitter over USB (when compatible) for ultimate realism. \n\nWe’d love your feedback to make this experience even better! So grab your headset, take to the skies, and let us know what you think or what you would like to see added next!",
